bees several times before, comes to you for
advice because the last time he was stung at
the back of his hand a few days ago, he
developed a large itchy swelling at the sting
Site which was different from previous times.
The swelling went down in 2-3 days with no
complications or remaining symptoms. Which
one of the following is the most appropriate
advice for him?','{"A":"He needs to take steroids after he is\nstung.","B":"He needs to take NSAIDs after he is\nstung.","C":"He should carry an EpiPen with him\nand use it immediately after he is\nstung.","D":"He needs to take antihistamine\ntablets regularly.","E":"He needs to apply antihistamine\ncream on the sting site immediately."}',NULL,NULL,'{"source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 Emergency Medicine 1.pdf","supporting_pages":[],"source_qid":null,"duplicate_group_id":"exact-0d68ac567613","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"e33c93cd6c8ef477ad46","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 Emergency Medicine 1.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 Emergency Medicine 1.pdf","source_page":235,"source_qid":null}],"parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"five_block_inferred","text_method":"tesseract_retry_200dpi_psm3","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'needs_verification','[]','low','{"record_id":"e33c93cd6c8ef477ad46","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 Emergency Medicine 1.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 Emergency Medicine 1.pdf","source_year":2025,"source_page":235,"source_qid":null,"domain_hint":"Emergency Medicine","stem":"A 52-year-old farmer, who had been stung by\nbees several times before, comes to you for\nadvice because the last time he was stung at\nthe back of his hand a few days ago, he\ndeveloped a large itchy swelling at the sting\nSite which was different from previous times.\nThe swelling went down in 2-3 days with no\ncomplications or remaining symptoms. Which\none of the following is the most appropriate\nadvice for him?","options":{"A":"He needs to take steroids after he is\nstung.","B":"He needs to take NSAIDs after he is\nstung.","C":"He should carry an EpiPen with him\nand use it immediately after he is\nstung.","D":"He needs to take antihistamine\ntablets regularly.","E":"He needs to apply antihistamine\nc