clinic for advice on breast cancer after her
maternal aunt was diagnosed with breast
cancer three months ago. She wants to know
about the risk factors of breast cancer. She is
obese and has a body mass index (BMI) of 45.
she smokes 20 cigarettes a day and is on oral
contraceptive pills (OCP). The rest of the
examination, including a breast exam, is
unremarkable. Which of the following pieces of
