clinic with complaints of mood swings,
palpitation, and fine tremors for the past few
weeks. Laboratory tests are ordered, and the
results are remarkable for a decreased TSH
level and normal T3 and T4. Which one of the
following is most likely to be the cause of this
presentation?','{"A":"Grave''s disease.","B":"Pregnancy.","C":"toxic thyroid nodule.","D":"Hyperthyroidism.","E":"Hypothyroidism."}',NULL,NULL,'{"source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 Endo_ breast 1-50.pdf","supporting_pages":[],"source_qid":null,"duplicate_group_id":"exact-d418b04607d7","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"415f6987901dd7759065","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 Endo_ breast 1-50.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 Endo_ breast 1-50.pdf","source_page":26,"source_qid":null},{"record_id":"04eeacde5acb1239da5b","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 Endo_ breast 1-50.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 Endo_ breast 1-50.pdf","source_page":27,"source_qid":null},{"record_id":"62e955bdc5bd1a340b4e","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"Amedex 2023.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Amedex 2023.pdf","source_page":170,"source_qid":"1032"}],"parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"five_block_inferred","text_method":"tesseract_retry_200dpi_psm3","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'needs_verification','[]','low','{"record_id":"415f6987901dd7759065","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 Endo_ breast 1-50.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 Endo_ breast 1-50.pdf","source_year":2025,"source_page":26,"source_qid":null,"domain_hint":"Endocrine/Breast","stem":"A 29-year-old woman presents to your GP\nclinic with complaints of mood swings,\npalpitation, and fine tremors for the past few\nweeks. Laboratory tests are ordered, and the\nresults are remarkable for a decreased TSH\nlevel and normal T3 and T4. Which one of the\nfollowing is most likely to be the cause of this\npresentation?","options":{"A":"Grave''s disease.","B":"Pregnancy.","C":"toxic thyroid nodule.","D":"Hyperthyroidism.","E":"Hypothyroidism."},"source_answer":null,"source_explanation":null,"source_answ