therapy with bisphosphonates is started.

(Option B)This patient has normal serum
calcium levels and does not need calcium
Supplementation. Moreover, calcium should not
be added to calcitriol therapy due to the risk of
hypercalcemia. Dietary calcium intake should be
maintained at 800 to 1000 mg daily.

(Option D) Testosterone replacement therapy is
the treatment of choice in osteoporotic men
with hypogonadism. Daniel’s testosterone level
is in the lower limit normal range. Judged by his
testosterone level, he is unlikely to have
hypogonadism.

(Option E) Adequate sun exposure should be
recommended to all patients to prevent vitamin
D deficiency. Daniel has severe vitamin D

deficiency and needs to be treated more

ageressively ratemtamiiee wi reun exposure.',NULL,'Retain the source-era answer for question-bank study; verify current Australian guidance before clinical use.',NULL,NULL,'2025','v2.9.4',1,'text','{"source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 Endo_ breast 1-50.pdf","supporting_pages":[30,31,32,33,34],"source_qid":null,"duplicate_group_id":null,"duplicate_sources":[],"parser_version":"manual-review-batch004-2026-09-24","parser_mode":"human_visual_review_batch004","text_method":"manual_visual_plus_context","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,'needs_verification','[]','high') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET source_id=excluded.source_id,source_question_no=excluded.source_question_no,source_page=excluded.source_page,domain=excluded.domain,system=excluded.system,topic=excluded.topic,clinical_task=excluded.clinical_task,stem_en=excluded.stem_en,answer_key=excluded.answer_key,source_explanation_en=excluded.source_explanation_en,memory_rule_en=excluded.memory_rule_en,image_ref=excluded.image_ref,source_year=excluded.source_year,import_version=excluded.import_version,active=1,options_mode=excluded.options_mode,provenance_json=excluded.provenance_json,current_answer=excluded.current_answer,current_answer_status=excluded.current_answer_status,current_evidence_json=excluded.current_evidence_json,currentness_risk=excluded.currentness_risk;
