practice with complaints of palpitation and
anxiousness. She has a past medical history
of hypertension and ischemic heart disease.
He also has hypothyroidism, for which she is
currently on levothyroxine 150 mcg daily.
Based on the history and clinical findings, you
Suspect hyperthyroidism caused by
overtreatment of her hypothyroidism. A
serum thyroid stimulation hormone (TSH)
confirms the diagnosis. You decrease the
dose of levothyroxine to 100 mcg daily. When
Should you perform a follow-up TSH level
again?','{"A":"After one day.","B":"After one week.","C":"After two weeks.","D":"After four weeks.","E":"After six months."}',NULL,NULL,'{"source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 Endo_ breast 1-50.pdf","supporting_pages":[51],"source_qid":null,"duplicate_group_id":"exact-e4a209af2fdf","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"b8d24577a745f1d91dc2","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 Endo_ breast 1-50.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 Endo_ breast 1-50.pdf","source_page":51,"source_qid":null}],"parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"v27_same_page_five_structural","text_method":"tesseract_retry_200dpi_psm3","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'needs_verification','[]','high','{"record_id":"b8d24577a745f1d91dc2","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 Endo_ breast 1-50.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 Endo_ breast 1-50.pdf","source_year":2025,"source_page":51,"supporting_pages":[51],"source_qid":null,"domain_hint":"Endocrine/Breast","stem":"A 64-year-old woman presents to your\npractice with complaints of palpitation and\nanxiousness. She has a past medical history\nof hypertension and ischemic heart disease.\nHe also has hypothyroidism, for which she is\ncurrently on levothyroxine 150 mcg daily.\nBased on the history and clinical findings, you\nSuspect hyperthyroidism caused by\novertreatment of her hypothyroidism. A\nserum thyroid stimulation hormone (TSH)\nconfirms the diagnosis. You decrease the\ndose of levothyroxine to 100 mcg daily. When\nShould you perform a follow-up TSH level\nagain?","options":{"A":"After one day.","B":"After one week.","C":"After two weeks.","D":"After four weeks.","E":"After six months."},"source_answer":null,"source_explanation":null,"source_answer_status":"pending_import","current_answer":null,"current_answer_status":"needs_verification","current_evidence":[],"currentness_risk":"high","currentness_keyword