your practice complaining of fatigue,
constipation, and weight gain for the past few
months. She has no prior history of neck
Surgery or radiation. On examination, she has
hoarseness and her skin is dry. You order
thyroid function tests (TFT) that reveal an
elevated serum thyroid stimulating hormone
(TSH) and decreased T4. Which one of the
following is the most likely cause of this
